{"id":"DAB-L4-BID-001","query":"客户说上一版太像小红书模板了，但又不能做得太老气，现有 Logo 不改。附件三个参考品牌风格并不一致，请先整理清楚，再给我三个真正不同的视觉方向，周五要拿去提案，后面还要延展淘宝主图和门店物料。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"brand_identity_directions","primary_intent":"generate","secondary_intents":["evaluate_rank","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"logo-upgrade-grain-glow-before-after","role":"current_logo_and_identity"},{"asset_id":"detail-page-quiet-ritual-reference-page","role":"premium_minimal_reference"},{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"color_system_reference"},{"asset_id":"design-vote-noma-logo-options","role":"friendly_logo_reference"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-BID-002","query":"附件是 NOMA 的 A–D 四个 Logo 方案。品牌希望现代、友好、缩小后仍容易识别，也要避免像房地产或通用 App 图标。请不要再画新 Logo，按这四项标准评分、排序并指出首选方案进入下一轮时只需要改什么。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"brand_identity_directions","primary_intent":"evaluate_rank","secondary_intents":["adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"design-vote-noma-logo-options","role":"logo_candidates"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-BID-003","query":"我们是做工业传感器的，旧视觉太像 2015 年的 SaaS。Logo 轮廓必须保留，但可以整理字标；主色继续用深蓝，不能做成赛博朋克。先给 3 个方向，选定后做中英文字标规范、官网 hero 和展会背板。销售团队希望技术感强，CEO 又说不要冷冰冰。","language":"mixed","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"brand_identity_directions","primary_intent":"generate","secondary_intents":["adapt","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"logo-upgrade-grain-glow-before-after","role":"current_identity"},{"asset_id":"design-vote-noma-logo-options","role":"monogram_reference"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-CAM-001","query":"我们要上线一款夜间香氛，品牌板和产品图都在附件。核心卖点是安静、低刺激、睡前仪式感，不要做成医疗助眠广告。请先出两个 KV 方向供内部选，再完成官网 hero、Instagram 竖版和邮件头图；Logo、米白底色和陶土红必须沿用。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"existing_brand_campaign","primary_intent":"generate","secondary_intents":["adapt","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"brand_guideline"},{"asset_id":"product-retouch-perfume-bottle-source","role":"launch_product"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-CAM-002","query":"这是已经通过的 SUMMER FORM 主海报，不要重新设计。请适配成 1200×628 website card、1080×1350 Instagram post 和 1080×1920 Story；标题、日期和地点必须完整，几何系统可以重排但不能只粗暴裁切。","language":"mixed","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"existing_brand_campaign","primary_intent":"adapt","secondary_intents":["edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"campaign_master"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-CAM-003","query":"这两张分别是偏品牌感和偏卖点型的 Campaign 参考，产品和品牌板也在附件。请按品牌一致性、首屏信息、移动端可读性和转化路径选一个方向，不要先画第三套；选完后把胜出方向做成天猫首图和详情页首屏。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"existing_brand_campaign","primary_intent":"evaluate_rank","secondary_intents":["adapt","generate"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"brand_guideline"},{"asset_id":"detail-page-quiet-ritual-reference-page","role":"campaign_candidate_a"},{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"campaign_candidate_b"},{"asset_id":"detail-page-terra-diffuser-product","role":"campaign_product"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-PSF-001","query":"MORI 基础款包装已经通过，结构、Logo 和信息层级都不要动。请把它延展成茉莉、乌龙、白桃、桂花、青柠五个 SKU；每个口味需要一眼能区分，但放在货架上必须还是同一家。先做两种色彩编码策略让我选，再展开完整系列。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"packaging_sku_family","primary_intent":"adapt","secondary_intents":["generate","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"brand_system"},{"asset_id":"sku-system-tumbler-base","role":"approved_base_packaging"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-PSF-002","query":"附件四款男士理容包装 A–D，请从货架识别、男性但不刻板、质感、Logo 可读和后续做洗面奶/剃须膏 SKU 的扩展性五方面评分。不要重新画包装，给完整排名，并指出首选方案量产前最该修的两个问题。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"packaging_sku_family","primary_intent":"evaluate_rank","secondary_intents":["edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"design-vote-mens-grooming-abcd","role":"packaging_candidates"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-PSF-003","query":"这个咖啡包装视觉已经定稿，要发给工厂打样。成品袋写的是 120×200 mm，但工厂模板邮件里又写 125×205 mm；背面法定净含量文案还没确认。请先做 preflight，别猜，确认能做的部分后输出 CMYK 300 dpi、3 mm bleed 的 PDF 和检查清单。","language":"mixed","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"packaging_sku_family","primary_intent":"export","secondary_intents":["edit","adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"factory-orbit-coffee-artwork","role":"print_artwork"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-ECO-001","query":"附件是蓝绿色便携音箱白底图和 MORI 品牌板。新品卖点是 12 小时续航、防泼水、可挂包。请先找两个场景方向，选定后做天猫主图、三张卖点图、详情页首屏和一张社媒场景海报；产品外观、接口和 Logo 不能变。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"ecommerce_launch_suite","primary_intent":"generate","secondary_intents":["edit","adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"product-retouch-teal-speaker-white-bg","role":"product_master"},{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"brand_guideline"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-ECO-002","query":"请精修附件香水瓶：去掉玻璃上的脏反光和灰雾，增强边缘通透感，背景保持纯净。瓶型、瓶盖、标签文字、液体颜色和画面构图都不能变；这是修图，不是重新生成一瓶。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"ecommerce_launch_suite","primary_intent":"edit","secondary_intents":["adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"product-retouch-perfume-bottle-source","role":"edit_target"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-ECO-003","query":"产品是陶土红香薰机，参考详情页偏冷白极简，但品牌板要求暖米色和陶土红。请先说明冲突，比较“严格跟参考版式”和“优先跟品牌语言”两个方向，选出更适合淘宝首屏的一个，再替换成我们的产品和文案。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"ecommerce_launch_suite","primary_intent":"evaluate_rank","secondary_intents":["adapt","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"detail-page-quiet-ritual-reference-page","role":"reference_detail_page"},{"asset_id":"detail-page-terra-diffuser-product","role":"product_reference"},{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"brand_guideline"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-MFA-001","query":"SUMMER FORM 主海报已经定稿，请批量适配 10 个尺寸：1:1、4:5、9:16、16:9、3:2、2:3、A4、A3、1200×628、1920×480。文字内容不能少，几何语言和蓝橙配色保持；允许为每个比例重新排版，不允许简单拉伸。","language":"mixed","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"multi_format_adaptation","primary_intent":"adapt","secondary_intents":["edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"approved_master"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-MFA-002","query":"这是通过的活动海报。我们需要小红书 3:4、Instagram 4:5、Story 9:16、微信头图 2.35:1、Meta 1200×628、官网 16:9 和现场横屏 3840×1080。先给一张 adaptation map 说明各尺寸怎么取舍，再批量输出；标题、日期、地点和报名 URL 都不能丢。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"multi_format_adaptation","primary_intent":"adapt","secondary_intents":["edit","export"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"approved_master"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-MFA-003","query":"按附件海报批量导出渠道表里的全部尺寸，今天下班前要。表里写着：小红书 1080×1440、Story 1080×1920、官网 1440×0、邮件 600×200、LED 4096×1024。不要漏项，但如果参数本身不可能，请先指出再继续。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"multi_format_adaptation","primary_intent":"export","secondary_intents":["adapt","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"approved_master"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-CFR-001","query":"这是客户已经看过的海报。客户只说“还是有点廉价，Logo 也太抢”，但上一轮明确通过了构图、蓝橙配色和活动信息。请先把这句话翻译成可确认的修改项，再出一个局部修改版本，没提到的地方不要重新生成。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"client_feedback_revision","primary_intent":"edit","secondary_intents":["evaluate_rank","adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"revision_target"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-CFR-002","query":"On the approved SUMMER FORM poster, enlarge only the main title by about 15% and move the small event mark to the top-right safe area. Keep every other element, all copy, colors, geometry, texture, and canvas size exactly as they are.","language":"en","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"client_feedback_revision","primary_intent":"edit","secondary_intents":["adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"revision_target"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-CFR-003","query":"这是详情页首屏和产品图。客户说喜欢 A 的产品构图，但要 B 那种更暖的配色；主标题用“让香气慢下来”，三个卖点照提供文案。请先做一版并记录哪些来自 A、哪些来自 B，下一轮还要给客户确认。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"client_feedback_revision","primary_intent":"edit","secondary_intents":["evaluate_rank","adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"detail-page-quiet-ritual-reference-page","role":"composition_reference_a"},{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"palette_reference_b"},{"asset_id":"detail-page-terra-diffuser-product","role":"product_reference"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-RTO-001","query":"我们要给陶土红香薰机做新品详情页。参考 1 喜欢它的大留白和信息节奏，参考 2 喜欢暖色系统，参考 3 只喜欢更大胆的几何构图；不要复制任何品牌、文字或具体图形。请先拆解三张 reference，再给三个原创方向，选定后完成首屏和两张卖点模块。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"reference_to_original","primary_intent":"generate","secondary_intents":["evaluate_rank","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"detail-page-quiet-ritual-reference-page","role":"layout_reference"},{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"palette_reference"},{"asset_id":"image-edit-poster-summer-form","role":"composition_reference"},{"asset_id":"detail-page-terra-diffuser-product","role":"product_reference"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-RTO-002","query":"Review the four NOMA logo candidates A–D for a warm, contemporary neighborhood food brand. Rank them on brief fit, small-size recognition, ownability, and risk of looking like a generic house/app/food icon. Do not generate another logo; flag any candidate that should be rejected for category cliché.","language":"mixed","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"reference_to_original","primary_intent":"evaluate_rank","secondary_intents":["edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"design-vote-noma-logo-options","role":"logo_candidates"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-RTO-003","query":"参考页的信息节奏客户很喜欢，但不能直接套皮。请保留“主标题—一句话卖点—三个功能—底部规格”的结构，把它改成我们的陶土红香薰机，使用提供文案和 MORI 暖色体系；参考页的花瓶、品牌名、图标和具体装饰都不能留下。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"reference_to_original","primary_intent":"edit","secondary_intents":["adapt","generate"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"detail-page-quiet-ritual-reference-page","role":"layout_reference"},{"asset_id":"detail-page-terra-diffuser-product","role":"product_reference"},{"asset_id":"sku-system-mori-brand-board","role":"brand_guideline"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L3-CFRY-001","query":"把附件 LUNA CLUB 透明贴纸图做成 60 mm 成品的生产包：外轮廓外扩 3 mm bleed，CutContour 专色刀线，CMYK 300 dpi；需要一份可预览 PNG、一份 SVG 和一份工厂 PDF。不要给我“怎么做”的说明海报。","language":"mixed","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L3","category":"concept_to_factory_ready","primary_intent":"export","secondary_intents":["edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"factory-luna-club-sticker","role":"sticker_artwork"}],"requires_feedback":false,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-CFRY-002","query":"客户只给了这张 LUNA CLUB 插画，说要做桌面亚克力立牌，成品大约 90 mm 高，底座想做透明但没给厚度和插槽。请先做方向和 mockup，列出报价缺什么；能确认后再出三视图、尺寸、CMF、白墨层和刀线文件，没给的工厂参数不要猜。","language":"zh-CN","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"concept_to_factory_ready","primary_intent":"export","secondary_intents":["generate","edit"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"factory-luna-club-sticker","role":"ip_artwork"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
{"id":"DAB-L4-CFRY-003","query":"Orbit Coffee 包装 artwork 已通过。请先按 120×200 mm 成品、3 mm bleed、CMYK 300 dpi 做 print proof 和生产 PDF，并输出 preflight；工厂打样后我会再给反馈。正面构图和品牌字样已锁定，不要把流程说明当成成品。","language":"mixed","layer":"l3_l4_brief_initial_query","capability_level":"L4","category":"concept_to_factory_ready","primary_intent":"export","secondary_intents":["edit","adapt"],"has_reference":true,"input_assets":[{"asset_id":"factory-orbit-coffee-artwork","role":"approved_print_artwork"}],"requires_feedback":true,"episode_source":"brief_bank/briefs.v0.1.jsonl"}
